[00:00.00]
[00:08.87]They flutter behind you, your possible pasts
[00:08.87]他们在你也许的过去背后闪烁
[00:16.75]Some bright-eyed and crazy, some frightened and lost
[00:16.75]一些天真 一些疯狂 一切失落
[00:26.12]A warning to anyone still in command
[00:26.12]告诉别人他始终在
[00:35.75]Of their possible future: take care
[00:35.75]指挥你们那些也许的未来
[00:45.62]In derelict sidings the poppies entwine
[00:45.62]罂粟花和等待出发的牛车
[00:54.12]With cattle trucks lying in wait for the next time
[00:54.12]交织在被抛弃的墙边
[01:05.50]Do you remember me? How we used to be?
[01:05.50]你还记得我吗？记得我们的从前吗？
[01:10.50]Do you think we should be closer?
[01:10.50]觉得我们可以更接近些吗？
[01:23.50]She stood in the doorway, the ghost of a smile
[01:23.50]她站在门口 一个微笑的幽灵
[01:32.19]Haunting her face like a cheap hotel sign
[01:32.19]她的脸萦绕 像廉价的旅馆招牌
[01:41.25]Her cold eyes imploring the men in their macs
[01:41.25]冰冷的眼睛乞求着陌生人的
[01:49.50]For the gold in their bags or the knives in their backs
[01:49.50]钱或刺进背里的刀子
[02:00.38]Stepping up boldly, one put out his hand
[02:00.38]突然一人站了起来伸出手
[02:08.13]He said, "I was just a child then; now I'm only a man"
[02:08.13]他说：我之前只是孩子 现在也只是一个人
[02:17.19]Do you remember me? How we used to be?
[02:17.19]你还记得我吗？记得我们的从前吗？
[02:22.50]Do you think we should be closer?
[02:22.50]觉得我们可以更接近些吗？
[03:20.35]By the cold and religious we were taken in hand
[03:20.35]冷风和宗教摆布我们
[03:28.98]Shown how to feel good and told to feel bad
[03:28.98]怎么觉得开心 和被通知觉得难过
[03:39.91]Tongue-tied and terrified, we learned how to pray
[03:39.91]结结巴巴和害怕的我们学会怎么去祈祷
[03:48.59]Now our feelings run deep and cold as the clay
[03:48.59]在我们在背后深藏着的情感比泥土还要冰冷
[03:53.65]Of our possible pasts lie in tatters and rags
[03:53.65]那些代表我们也许的过去的标语和旗帜被扔在了一堆垃圾之中
[04:01.96]Do you remember me? How we used to be?
[04:01.96]你还记得我吗？记得我们的从前吗？
[04:07.27]Do you think we should be closer?
[04:07.27]觉得我们可以更接近些吗？
